{"title": "Contents", "index": 57, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\" id=\"1DOR00-8f9af0b96e4e445a870a9cd93b28c0ad\">\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-title\">\n    目录\n  </div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level\">\n<a href=\"part0049.html#1ENBI0-8f9af0b96e4e445a870a9cd93b28c0ad\">总 序</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level\">\n<a href=\"part0051.html#1GKCM0-8f9af0b96e4e445a870a9cd93b28c0ad\">编译前言</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_000.html#1HIT80-8f9af0b96e4e445a870a9cd93b28c0ad\">第一部分</a>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_001.html#sigil_toc_id_1\">一、数学基础</a>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_001.html#sigil_toc_id_2\">（一）数学：与游戏相比</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_001.html#sigil_toc_id_3\">（二）绝没有元数学</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_001.html#sigil_toc_id_4\">（三）相关性证明</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_001.html#sigil_toc_id_5\">（四）无矛盾性证明</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_001.html#sigil_toc_id_6\">（五）算术的基础之确立：在此过程中它为 它的应用做好了准备。（罗素、兰姆西。）</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_001.html#sigil_toc_id_7\">（六）兰姆西的同一性理论</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_001.html#sigil_toc_id_8\">（七）算术（数学）的应用概念</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_002.html#sigil_toc_id_9\">二、论基数</a>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_002.html#sigil_toc_id_10\">（一）基数的种类</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_002.html#sigil_toc_id_11\">（二）2＋2＝4</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_002.html#sigil_toc_id_12\">（三）数学内部的数陈述</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_002.html#sigil_toc_id_13\">（四）数相同 长度相同</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_003.html#sigil_toc_id_14\">三、数学证明</a>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_003.html#sigil_toc_id_15\">（一）当我在其他情形中寻找某种东西时， 我能够描述找到时的情况—— 即使在它还没有出现时；当我寻找一个 数学问题的解决办法时，情况就不一样了。 数学探险和极地探险</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_003.html#sigil_toc_id_16\">（二）一个数学命题的证明及其真和假</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_003.html#sigil_toc_id_17\">（三）如果你想要知道什么得到了证明，那么请查看证明</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_003.html#sigil_toc_id_18\">（四）数学问题 问题的种类 寻找 数学的“任务”</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_003.html#sigil_toc_id_19\">（五）欧拉证明</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_003.html#sigil_toc_id_20\">（六）角的三等分等等</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_003.html#sigil_toc_id_21\">（七）寻找和试图</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_004.html#sigil_toc_id_22\">四、归纳证明 循环性</a>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_004.html#sigil_toc_id_23\">（一）在什么范围内一个归纳证明 证明了一个命题？</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_004.html#sigil_toc_id_24\">（二）递归证明和命题的概念。 这种证明将一个命题证明为真的并且 将其反面证明为假的了吗？</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_004.html#sigil_toc_id_25\">（三）归纳，（x）. ɸx和（）. ɸx。 在什么范围内归纳将一个一般命题证明 为真的，将一个存在命题证明为假的？</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_004.html#sigil_toc_id_26\">（四）从递归证明的写出人们推导出了一个 有关一般性的进一步的结论了吗？递归图式 不是已经说出了所有应当说出的东西了吗？</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_004.html#sigil_toc_id_27\">（五）在什么范围内一个递归证明配得“证明” 这个称呼？在什么范围内根据范型A 进行的过渡经由B的证明得到辩护了？</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_004.html#sigil_toc_id_28\">（六）递归证明没有缩减基本规律的数目</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_004.html#sigil_toc_id_29\">（七）循环性。 1÷3=0.</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_004.html#sigil_toc_id_30\">（八）作为证明的序列的递归证明</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_004.html#sigil_toc_id_31\">（九）以特定的方式看一个符号，理解一个符号。 一个数学表达式的一个面相的发现。 “以特定的方式看这个表达式。” 强调</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_004.html#sigil_toc_id_32\">（十）归纳证明，算术和代数</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_005.html#sigil_toc_id_33\">五、数学中的无穷 外延的看法</a>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_005.html#sigil_toc_id_34\">（一）算术中的一般性</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_005.html#sigil_toc_id_35\">（二）论集合论</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_005.html#sigil_toc_id_36\">（三）实数的延展的理解</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_005.html#sigil_toc_id_37\">（四）无理数的种类 （π′，P，F）</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level1\">\n<a href=\"part0052_split_005.html#sigil_toc_id_38\">（五）不规则的无穷小数</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level\">\n<a href=\"part0053.html#1IHDQ0-8f9af0b96e4e445a870a9cd93b28c0ad\">第二部分</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level\">\n<a href=\"part0054.html#1JFUC0-8f9af0b96e4e445a870a9cd93b28c0ad\">第三部分</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sgc-toc-level\">\n<a href=\"part0000.html#0-8f9af0b96e4e445a870a9cd93b28c0ad\">返回总目录</a>\n</div>\n</body>"}]}